-solution "First, we find the principal value:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(15)=86.185\\,925{…}^{∘}≈{86.19}^{∘}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince ${86.19}^{∘}$ lies inside the given domain, our first solution is ${x}_{1}={86.19}^{∘}.$\n\nTo generate more solutions, we add integer multiples of ${180}^{∘}.$ Hence,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{2}={180}^{∘}+{86.19}^{∘}={266.19}^{∘}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the solutions are\n\n$$\nx={86}^{∘},{266}^{∘}\n$$\n\nrounded to the nearest integer." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-121264/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d8c7ab50-5a8b-5bcd-8483-cec8bf6bd3ce"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-121264"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-321633/field-1/55a4398ff2bb390f50308343800529dea9dc0d15acc52b6cb929bee17c075b16" :answer/id #uuid "1c1db736-47c4-5884-97a2-64793a6995ca" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1.4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-321633/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "226182eb-75df-5f62-91f7-8a1158dfca83" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-321633/field-1/55a4398ff2bb390f50308343800529dea9dc0d15acc52b6cb929bee17c075b16" :answer-field/choices ["q-321633/field-1/55a4398ff2bb390f50308343800529dea9dc0d15acc52b6cb929bee17c075b16"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-321633/field-2/2e594a91a7fc076c26fb8d390c04bd0caf97132493c53792bc85e8e8e84d973a" :answer/id #uuid "aad80ec1-0d8b-50cb-9761-67066f15300b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4.6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-321633/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "d4862876-3eb2-5bbb-96b9-76d718bc7d03" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-321633/field-2/2e594a91a7fc076c26fb8d390c04bd0caf97132493c53792bc85e8e8e84d973a" :answer-field/choices ["q-321633/field-2/2e594a91a7fc076c26fb8d390c04bd0ca